        ],
        "params": {
          "text_format": "markdown",
          "width": 1100,
          "height": 210,
          "font_size": 17,
          "text": "**Live FM stereo · 88.7 MHz**  \nThe SoapySDR source tunes Українське Радіо — Чернігівська хвиля on RX channel 0. The decoder tracks the 19 kHz pilot and blends to mono when the pilot fades.  \nPress F5 in Studio to listen continuously and Shift+F5 to stop. See the [FM receiver guide](qrc:/s7studio/help/examples/sdr/FM_RECEIVER.md) for device and station settings."
        }
      }
    ]
